<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Berzack raises interim shr, div.</title>
<headline>Berzack raises interim shr, div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Dec 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     71.6	  vs   64.6</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 13.5	  vs   12.5</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   20.02	 vs   17.52</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   20.58	 vs   18.24</p>
<p>    Tax			  0.79	 vs    0.57</p>
<p>    Finance costs	    1.17	 vs    2.67</p>
<p>    Turnover		  63.31	 vs   58.13</p>
<p>Div payable May 2</p>
<p>on register March 27</p>
<p>Full name: Berzack Brothers Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
